    <h2>3. Content Disclaimer</h2>
    <p>The reviews, comparisons, and opinions expressed on this Website are based on our own research and testing. While we strive for accuracy:</p>
    <ul>
      <li>AI tools and their features may change after our reviews are published.</li>
      <li>Pricing information is subject to change by the respective tool providers.</li>
      <li>Our reviews reflect our subjective experience and may differ from yours.</li>
      <li>We do not guarantee that any AI tool will meet your specific requirements.</li>
